Boolean and QF_LRA inputs for the Lean certification cells of scripts/proofs/proof_matrix.py.

Each file is a small unsat query whose native Z3 proof the
reconstructor in Z3Prover/z3 (examples/python/proof_to_lean.py) must turn into
a Lean term that the pinned Lean toolchain accepts. The z3 CI job releaseClang
runs the matrix with --lean over the matching inputs and fails unless every
file is reported as lean-verified.

The legacy-proof-object cell handles the Boolean inputs:

  unit_resolution.smt2     contradiction closed by preprocessing alone
  boolean_rewrite.smt2     implication rewriting and mp
  boolean_structural.smt2  trans, monotonicity, not-or-elim
  boolean_branching.smt2   scoped learning (hypothesis and lemma)
  boolean_def_axiom.smt2   gate clauses (def-axiom)
  boolean_solve_eqs.smt2   solve-eqs elimination followed by search

The smt-clause-log-nopp cell handles the QF_LRA inputs:

  lra_farkas.smt2            nontrivial Farkas coefficients
  lra_equality.smt2          equality and strict inequalities
  lra_fractions.smt2         exact rational constants
  lra_boolean_structure.smt2 mixed Boolean and arithmetic structure
  lra_split_assertion.smt2   preprocessing splits an xor and an equivalence
  lra_implied_equality.smt2  implied-eq hints ending in a disequality
  lra_distinct.smt2          alldiff clauses bound to the original assertion
  lra_unary_minus.smt2       negative variable coefficients in scaling helpers

Run from a z3 checkout with a POSIX CMake build in build/:

  python3 ../z3test/scripts/proofs/proof_matrix.py \
    --z3 "$PWD/build/z3" --z3-source "$PWD" \
    --lean --cells legacy-proof-object --timeout 30 \
    --lean-artifacts /tmp/lean-proof-artifacts --out /tmp/lean-proof-matrix.jsonl \
    ../z3test/regressions/proofs/lean/boolean_*.smt2 \
    ../z3test/regressions/proofs/lean/unit_resolution.smt2

  python3 ../z3test/scripts/proofs/proof_matrix.py \
    --z3 "$PWD/build/z3" --z3-source "$PWD" \
    --lean --cells smt-clause-log-nopp --timeout 30 \
    --lean-artifacts /tmp/lean-proof-artifacts --out /tmp/lean-proof-matrix.jsonl \
    ../z3test/regressions/proofs/lean/lra_*.smt2

The QF_LRA cell requires the clause-log exporter and arithmetic Lean
reconstructor from the Z3 checkout, including implied-eq, alldiff, and unary
negation support. It preserves the original assertion boundary and checks the
recorded certificate rather than exporting a second proof.
